  triage:title "No canonical-write architecture gate test exists to enforce single-dispatch-point invariant" ;
  triage:description "AI7-QA-1 (req-qa and arch-qa independent confirmations). Sprint-ai-7.md explicitly lists in its 'Required validation' section: 'canonical-write architecture gate'. This test does not exist. The acceptance criteria specify 'One structural call graph reaches storage and post-write emission for all write ingress sources' — this is the architectural invariant that must be enforced by a gate test and cannot be verified manually. The test must prevent regression of multiple dispatch paths." ;
